    "comment_text": "I'm Thai and my fiance is French. I went to his house to celebrate his birthday and he bought me a ring to propose. A week later, he went to work in another province and had a heart attack. He was in the ICU for only one night and then he left me forever. I lost my fiance in September 2024. We were planning our wedding. It happened so quickly and I didn't get to say goodbye to him while he was alive. I only got to say goodbye to him when he was able to breathe on a ventilator. After he died, I dreamt of him traveling to different places together before he said goodbye to me in his final moments. Thank you, Lisa, for making this short film.",
